# Allowlist style: exclude everything, then re-include only what the Dockerfile COPYs.
# This keeps the build context small/reproducible and matches the Dockerfile's comment (D-2,
# PR #13 review NB-3) that .git, target/, spikes/, .delivery/ and .claude/ never reach the builder.
*

!src
!build.rs
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!rust-toolchain.toml
